        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_19_0_4_b1702d9_1651589657065_278453_59308"/>
        <body>An Observation is a record of something that occures or has occured during the life of a product or its support environment. Its use is restricted to observations not directly represented in the data model, and should not be used where some other reporting data structure is defined.</body>
      </ownedComment>
