          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_19_0_4_b1702d9_1651589658865_280075_59449"/>
          <body>the context in which the observation is made. The value of this attribute need not be specified.&lt;example&gt; A problem is found during a product design. The set of contexts can include the affected product, product configuration, or project, the affected parts or assemblies including geometry&lt;/example&gt;&lt;example&gt; A problem is found during a maintenance operation. The set of contexts can include the equipment being maintained, the end product the equipment is fitted to, the activity being undertaken, the manual that describes the activity and the resources being used. &lt;/example&gt;</body>
