        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193288_663519_23915"/>
        <body>A WorkOrder is an authorization for one or more Activity objects to be performed. &lt;note&gt; One or more means that it is controlling the main activity and any sub-activity related to the activity by ActivityRelationship with relationType of 'decomposition'. &lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
