    <packagedElement xmi:id="_19_0_4_b1702d9_1651591325047_670311_63349" xmi:uuid="ce097616-74bf-4218-a435-5ae5f319cdfb" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_19_0_4_b1702d9_1651591326083_597029_63458" xmi:uuid="9c1d8f06-4b63-4b5c-aa5f-639104139c3a" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_19_0_4_b1702d9_1651591325047_670311_63349"/>
        <body>An ObservationConsequence is an association of an observation to the consequences that follow from it, where those consequences are in the form of an activity to be performed.&lt;note&gt; One of the uses of ObservationConsequence is to close one of the feedback loops from the use of a product to requests for its enhancements. &lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>ObservationConsequence</name>
